LUU Y VE DU LIEU: Giay phep nay ap dung cho MA NGUON trong repository.
Bo du lieu Kaggle Stroke Prediction Dataset (fedesoriano) tuan theo giay phep
rieng cua Kaggle (Educational / Research License) va KHONG duoc phan phoi kem
repository nay. Cac tep PDF bai bao trong `data/SSoT_pdf_references/` thuoc
ban quyen cua nha xuat ban tuong ung, chi luu tru cuc bo phuc vu truy xuat
nguon goc (traceability), khong commit len repository cong khai.
